{"id":"624166","name":"茼蒿木耳拌虾仁","author":"一溪月","authorId":"10449735","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/624166/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"茼蒿","amount":"适量"},{"name":"木耳","amount":"适量"},{"name":"虾仁","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"小米椒","amount":"适量"},{"name":"香菜","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"茼蒿择洗净。","img":"images/624166/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"切三指段。","img":"images/624166/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"开水中焯至断生，捞出过凉水。","img":"images/624166/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"虾去头，去壳，去虾线，洗净，切小段。","img":"images/624166/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"把虾焯熟。","img":"images/624166/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"捞出洗去浮沫儿，虾肉更洁白。","img":"images/624166/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"泡发焯过水的木耳。","img":"images/624166/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"茼蒿，木耳，虾仁放盘子里。","img":"images/624166/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"小米椒，香菜，蒜蓉。","img":"images/624166/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"小米椒，香菜，蒜蓉放中间。","img":"images/624166/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"适量盐，生抽，香油，米醋，辣椒红冲调个料汁儿。","img":"images/624166/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"淋上面即可。","img":"images/624166/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/624166/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}